#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile {#transpile}"
msgstr "Transpil {#transpile}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, transpile the circuits for the QPU. You will compare the performance "
"of the transpiler with `optimization_level` set to `0` (lowest) against `3` "
"(highest). The lowest optimization level does the bare minimum needed to get"
" the circuit running on the device; it maps the circuit qubits to the device"
" qubits and adds swap gates to allow all two-qubit operations. The highest "
"optimization level is much smarter and uses lots of tricks to reduce the "
"overall gate count. Since multi-qubit gates have high error rates and qubits"
" decohere over time, the shorter circuits should give better results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seterusnya, transpil Circuit untuk QPU. Anda akan membandingkan prestasi "
"Transpiler dengan `optimization_level` ditetapkan kepada `0` (terendah) "
"berbanding `3` (tertinggi). Tahap pengoptimuman terendah melakukan yang "
"minimum yang diperlukan untuk menjalankan Circuit pada peranti; ia memetakan"
" qubit Circuit kepada qubit peranti dan menambah gate swap untuk membenarkan"
" semua operasi dua qubit. Tahap pengoptimuman tertinggi jauh lebih pintar "
"dan menggunakan banyak helah untuk mengurangkan jumlah bilangan gate. Oleh "
"sebab gate berbilang qubit mempunyai kadar ralat yang tinggi dan qubit "
"menyahkoheren dari masa ke masa, Circuit yang lebih pendek seharusnya "
"memberikan keputusan yang lebih baik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"important\">\n"
"This example uses IBM Quantum&reg; hardware, but you can try it on any Qiskit-compatible QPU.  Your results might be different.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"important\">\n"
"Contoh ini menggunakan perkakasan IBM Quantum&reg;, tetapi anda boleh mencubanya pada mana-mana QPU yang serasi dengan Qiskit.  Keputusan anda mungkin berbeza.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following cell transpiles `qc` for both values of `optimization_level`, "
"prints the number of two-qubit gates, and adds the transpiled circuits to a "
"list. Some of the transpiler's algorithms are randomized, so it sets a seed "
"for reproducibility.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sel berikut mentranspil `qc` untuk kedua-dua nilai `optimization_level`, "
"mencetak bilangan gate dua qubit, dan menambah Circuit yang ditranspil ke "
"dalam senarai. Sesetengah algoritma Transpiler adalah rawak, jadi ia "
"menetapkan benih untuk kebolehulangan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Since CNOTs usually have a high error rate, the circuit transpiled with "
"`optimization_level=3` should perform much better.\n"
msgstr ""
"Oleh sebab CNOT biasanya mempunyai kadar ralat yang tinggi, Circuit yang "
"ditranspil dengan `optimization_level=3` seharusnya berprestasi jauh lebih "
"baik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Another way you can improve performance is through [dynamical "
"decoupling](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.PadDynamicalDecoupling),"
" by applying a sequence of gates to idling qubits. This cancels out some "
"unwanted interactions with the environment. The following cell adds dynamic "
"decoupling to the circuit transpiled with `optimization_level=3` and adds it"
" to the list.\n"
msgstr ""
"Satu lagi cara anda boleh meningkatkan prestasi ialah melalui "
"[penyahgandingan "
"dinamikal](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.PadDynamicalDecoupling),"
" dengan menggunakan urutan gate pada qubit yang melahu. Ini membatalkan "
"beberapa interaksi yang tidak dikehendaki dengan persekitaran. Sel berikut "
"menambah penyahgandingan dinamikal kepada Circuit yang ditranspil dengan "
"`optimization_level=3` dan menambahnya ke dalam senarai.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/circuit-"
"transpilation-settings/extracted-outputs/c1c91fbd-"
"acfe-413e-a6c9-ad97f4dd5543-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/circuit-"
"transpilation-settings/extracted-outputs/c1c91fbd-"
"acfe-413e-a6c9-ad97f4dd5543-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Execute the circuit {#execute-the-circuit}"
msgstr "Laksanakan Circuit {#execute-the-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"At this point, you have a list of circuits transpiled with different "
"settings. Next, run these circuits using the Sampler primitive and store the"
" results to `result`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada ketika ini, anda mempunyai senarai Circuit yang ditranspil dengan "
"tetapan yang berbeza. Seterusnya, jalankan Circuit ini menggunakan primitif "
"Sampler dan simpan keputusan ke `result`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View results {#view-results}"
msgstr "Lihat keputusan {#view-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, plot the results from the device runs against the ideal "
"distribution. You can see the results with `optimization_level=3` are closer"
" to the ideal distribution due to the lower gate count, and "
"`optimization_level=3 + dd` is even closer due to the dynamical "
"decoupling.\n"
msgstr ""
"Akhir sekali, plot keputusan daripada jalankan peranti berbanding taburan "
"ideal. Anda boleh melihat keputusan dengan `optimization_level=3` lebih "
"hampir kepada taburan ideal disebabkan bilangan gate yang lebih rendah, dan "
"`optimization_level=3 + dd` lebih hampir lagi disebabkan penyahgandingan "
"dinamikal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/circuit-"
"transpilation-settings/extracted-outputs/9e86132d-a8b2-40db-"
"af42-53042dfa108b-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/circuit-"
"transpilation-settings/extracted-outputs/9e86132d-a8b2-40db-"
"af42-53042dfa108b-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can confirm this by computing the [Hellinger "
"fidelity](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info) between each"
" set of results and the ideal distribution (higher is better, and 1 is "
"perfect fidelity).\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh mengesahkan ini dengan mengira [kesetiaan "
"Hellinger](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info) antara "
"setiap set keputusan dan taburan ideal (lebih tinggi adalah lebih baik, dan "
"1 adalah kesetiaan sempurna).\n"

